# `.claude/` is local agent state, EXCEPT shared skills: Claude Code reads
# .claude/skills, Codex reads .agents/skills via symlink — one committed source.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
docs/superpowers/
/vite-iframe-*.png
/vite-running-in-browser.png

# `build/` (above) is for build OUTPUT, but apps/playground/build/ holds SOURCE
# (sw-plugin.ts, imported by vite.config.ts → in tsconfig include). Without this,
# a fresh checkout is missing the file and playground typecheck/build go red.
!apps/playground/build/
!apps/playground/build/**

